### CRUD and queries

Using `{{ example.entity_class }}` (primary key type `{{ example.key_type_name }}`) as an example, here are the representative operations.

```csharp
// Insert
var entity = new {{ example.entity_class }}();
await {{ example.repository_field }}.InsertAsync(entity);

// Get by primary key
var found = await {{ example.repository_field }}.GetByIdAsync({{ example.sample_key_literal }});

// Get all
var all = await {{ example.repository_field }}.GetAllAsync();

// Query (filter / order)
var results = await {{ example.repository_field }}
    .Query()
    .OrderBy(x => x.{{ example.order_property }})
    .ToListAsync();

// Update / delete
if (found is not null)
{
    await {{ example.repository_field }}.UpdateAsync(found);
    await {{ example.repository_field }}.DeleteAsync({{ example.sample_key_literal }});
}
```
